<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Ruling RCD party starts three-day meeting on reforming structure and grassroot action. Prime minister calls for mobilisation to respond to future threats.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Transport minister calls for modernisation of the sector.</p>
</text>
